abstract: >-
  Manuscript, exact execution notebooks, frozen patient partitions, validated
  result manifests, summary metrics, statistical analyses, figures, and audit
  records for a patient-grouped benchmark of volumetric postoperative glioma
  segmentation pipelines using the MU-Glioma-Post collection.
